# Keep the working tree LF regardless of the machine's core.autocrlf.
#
# This repository is a plugin whose files are diffed line by line, hashed to prove
# that an experiment was reverted, and imported as ES modules. With
# `core.autocrlf=true` and no file saying otherwise, `git checkout -- <file>`
# rewrites LF as CRLF, which silently invalidates every byte-for-byte restore check
# and produces spurious whole-file diffs on Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Nothing in this plugin is generated, but these must never be line-folded.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary